{'symbol': 'TMUS', 'date': '2022-11-29 06:00:00', 'title': 'EXTENET SYSTEMS ANNOUNCES EXCLUSIVE, EXPANDED PARTNERSHIP WITH T-MOBILE', 'text': "T-MOBILE PAIRS WITH EXTENET'S DIGITAL WIRELESS INFRASTRUCTURE DEPLOYED IN COMMERCIAL VENUES, CREATING UNPARALLELED COMMUNICATIONS EXPERIENCES FOR GUESTS AND USERS VENUE CONTRACTS COUPLE EXTENET'S INFRASTRUCTURE DEPLOYMENT WITH PRIMARY WIRELESS CARRIER, AN INDUSTRY FIRST IN ENABLING COST-EFFECTIVE 5G WIRELESS CAPABILITIES LISLE, ILL. , NOV. 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EXTENET SYSTEMS , A LEADING PRIVATELY HELD OWNER OF LTE/5G WIRELESS AND FIBER NEUTRAL-HOST COMMUNICATIONS INFRASTRUCTURE, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS ENTERED AN EXCLUSIVE AGREEMENT WITH T-MOBILE (NASDAQ: TMUS) TO DEPLOY DIGITAL WIRELESS INFRASTRUCTURE IN LARGE SPORTS, ENTERTAINMENT, HOSPITALITY AND TRANSPORTATION VENUES, AS WELL AS TO RATIONALIZE AND DECOMMISSION T-MOBILE'S OVERLAPPING NETWORK ASSETS INHERITED FROM ITS MERGER WITH SPRINT."}